@baseUrl    = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = PASTE_TOKEN_ADMIN_DISINI


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  DASHBOARD
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Dashboard Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  KATEGORI PEKERJAAN
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Kategori (publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Detail Kategori
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### Buat Kategori
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "description": "Pekerjaan di bidang AI dan Machine Learning"
}

### Update Kategori
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AI & Machine Learning",
  "description": "Pekerjaan di bidang AI, ML, dan Data Science"
}

### Hapus Kategori
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  PERUSAHAAN
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Perusahaan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Detail Perusahaan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Buat Perusahaan (atas nama admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PT Teknologi Nusantara",
  "email": "info@teknusantara.com",
  "phone": "021-5551234",
  "description": "Perusahaan teknologi software house",
  "website": "https://teknusantara.com",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "industry": "Teknologi Informasi",
  "company_size": "51-200"
}

### Verifikasi Perusahaan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/1/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Assign Recruiter ke Perusahaan
### (recruiter_user_id = ID user dengan role recruiter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/1/assign-recruiter
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recruiter_user_id": 4
}

### Hapus Perusahaan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  LOWONGAN KERJA
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Lowongan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

### Buat Lowongan (admin tentukan company_id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1,
  "title": "Backend Developer",
  "description": "Membangun dan memelihara API REST menggunakan Node.js",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "job_type": "full-time",
  "education_required": "S1",
  "experience_min_years": 2,
  "salary_min": 8000000,
  "salary_max": 15000000,
  "required_skills": ["nodejs", "mysql", "express", "rest-api"],
  "deadline": "2026-08-31",
  "status": "open"
}

### Update Lowongan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Backend Developer",
  "description": "Membangun API REST skala enterprise",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "job_type": "full-time",
  "education_required": "S1",
  "experience_min_years": 3,
  "salary_min": 12000000,
  "salary_max": 20000000,
  "required_skills": ["nodejs", "mysql", "express", "redis", "docker"],
  "status": "open"
}

### Hapus Lowongan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  LAMARAN KERJA
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Lamaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lihat Pelamar per Job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/job/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update Status Lamaran
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Reviewed"
}

### Hapus Lamaran
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  MATCHING KANDIDAT
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Match Kandidat untuk Job (skor 0–100)
### Skills 50 + Pendidikan 20 + Pengalaman 20 + Lokasi 10
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matching/job/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
